could be a way for Fomorians, Denizens or Thallain to have gained access to the Autumn world.<br /> <br /> On THAT note, the channeling efforts of Nazi Occultists could have delved into the Dreaming prisons of the White Court (?) and gained terrible insight and aid from these Elder Dark monsters.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#181818\"><span style=\"font-family:Merriweather\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">\u201cHumpty had always sat on walls, it was his way.\u201d </span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#181818\"><span style=\"font-family:Merriweather\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">\u2015 </span></span></span><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Lato\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Jasper Fforde, </span></b></span></span><span style=\"color:#181818\"><span style=\"font-family:Merriweather\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.goodreads.com/work/quotes/2504943\" target=\"_blank\">The Big Over Easy</a></span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1756-mythadvocate","name":"MythAdvocate","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1756_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"444"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-05T15:27:45-08:00","id":1192076,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MythAdvocate</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1191094-astral-projection-and-the-dreaming?p=1191891#post1191891\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Yes. But the Astral Projection Numina in Hunters Hunted 2 says to look to VtM 20 Auspex for info on Astral travel. And that explicitly ststes that Astral travel can lead to other &quot;spirit worlds&quot;. Hence my initial pondering on travel to the Dreaming. Strikes me this could be a way for Fomorians, Denizens or Thallain to have gained access to the Autumn world.<br /> <br /> On THAT note, the channeling efforts of Nazi Occultists could have delved into the Dreaming prisons of the White Court (?) and gained terrible insight and aid from these Elder Dark monsters.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Its a neat idea, I'm just saying when they mean &quot;spirit worlds&quot; its specifically the High/Astral umbra as of Umbra 20. This doesn't mean you can't and shouldn't change this, and allowing Malkavians to project into the Dreaming could reconnect to their older edition fairy connections, as would Toreador Glamour obsession and Tremere explicit statements on not angering the fae in their oath.<br /> <br /> <br /> I still think though that Human projectors have an issue other races do not, that humans, even Human plus(which I'd include both Numina and most Mages) have a bodies that can be stolen. There's even a Dark Kin type that represent human ghosts who have lost their bodies and exist in the Dreaming.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-06T06:56:31-08:00","id":1192236,"title":"","content":"Dark kin and Thallain killing Astrally wandering mortals and stealing the body is a great plot twist. <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-di